  "details": "I'm not sure if anyone else has requested this specifically but it'd be cool if we could change the hues of some of the existing items/skins. For example with the Magician bundle, I'd like to change the hue of the warp (Sigil of Teleportation) to a different color other than blue. Same with the portal skins, the rune details on Runic Gateway are blue. If we are able to customize most of our items, we should be able to do the same with the skins. Little things like these would probably give people more of an incentive to purchase these skins/items if we had more options for customization. More bang for our buck!",
